---
// About section
---

<section class="about-section" id="about">
  <div class="about-container reveal">
    <span class="section-label">About Us</span>
    <h2 class="section-title">Hi we're Meg & Ryker 👋</h2>
    <p class="about-text">
      We are newlyweds who packed up our lives in <em>Seattle</em>, quit our jobs, and set off to spend a year exploring the world. We are finding our way and learning what we want from this year! From Muay Thai in Thailand, volcano hiking in Indo, or a surf camp in Bali... we're finding that the best things are athletic, with interesting people, who also aren't afraid to have 1,000,000 beers... and writing about it along the way.
    </p>
    <div class="about-contact">
      <a href="https://instagram.com/rykurr" target="_blank" rel="noopener">📸 @rykurr</a>
      <span class="contact-divider">·</span>
      <a href="https://instagram.com/moogan__" target="_blank" rel="noopener">📸 @moogan__</a>
    </div>
    <div class="about-names">the Coreys — est. 2025</div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .about-section {
    padding: 6rem 2rem;
    background: var(--cream);
  }

  .about-container {
    max-width: 900px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .about-text {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: clamp(1.2rem, 2.5vw, 1.8rem);
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: rgba(0,0,0,0.7);
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }

  .about-text em {
    color: var(--coral);
    font-style: italic;
  }

  .about-names {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.3em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: rgba(0,0,0,0.3);
  }

  .about-contact {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .about-contact a {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: var(--coral);
    text-decoration: none;
    letter-spacing: 0.02em;
    transition: opacity 0.2s;
  }

  .about-contact a:hover {
    opacity: 0.7;
  }

  .contact-divider {
    color: rgba(0,0,0,0.2);
    font-size: 1.2rem;
  }
</style>
